@page "/components/focus-first-invalid"

<PageTitle>Focus First Invalid</PageTitle>

<RzQuickReferenceContainer>
    <RzArticle ProseWidth="ProseWidth.Wide">
        <SideContent>
            <RzQuickReference />
        </SideContent>
        <MainContent>
            <RzBreadcrumb class="mb-4 not-prose">
                <BreadcrumbList>
                    <BreadcrumbItem><BreadcrumbLink Href="/" hx-boost="true" hx-select="#content" hx-target="#content" hx-swap="outerHTML">Docs</BreadcrumbLink></BreadcrumbItem>
                    <BreadcrumbSeparator />
                    <BreadcrumbItem><BreadcrumbLink Href="/components" hx-boost="true" hx-select="#content" hx-target="#content" hx-swap="outerHTML">Components</BreadcrumbLink></BreadcrumbItem>
                    <BreadcrumbSeparator />
                    <BreadcrumbItem><BreadcrumbPage>Focus First Invalid</BreadcrumbPage></BreadcrumbItem>
                </BreadcrumbList>
            </RzBreadcrumb>
            <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H1" QuickReferenceTitle="Focus First Invalid" class="scroll-mt-20">Focus First Invalid</RzHeading>
            <RzParagraph>Place <code>&lt;RzFocusFirstInvalid /&gt;</code> inside a form. When the form renders with validation errors, typically after the server answered 422 and htmx swapped it in, focus moves to the first invalid field, so keyboard and screen reader users land on the problem. For controls that hide their native element (comboboxes, visually hidden checkboxes and switches), the visible control of the same field takes focus.</RzParagraph>
            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Usage" class="scroll-mt-20">Usage</RzHeading>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor" class="mb-10">
&lt;EditForm Model="Model" FormName="contact" hx-post="/contact" hx-swap="outerHTML"&gt;
    &lt;RzFocusFirstInvalid /&gt;
    &lt;RzModelStateProvider /&gt;
    ...
&lt;/EditForm&gt;
                </RzCodeViewer>
                <RzParagraph>It renders a hidden element and has no parameters of its own.</RzParagraph>
            </section>
        </MainContent>
    </RzArticle>
</RzQuickReferenceContainer>
